RAM layout for Herdr
Copyright 2026 officialparacite
https://github.com/officialparacite/herdr-ram

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It includes
parts from these projects:

- mods/ram/model.js (the agents, their exit history and the towers' sizes) is
  the model of the Night City layout, and mods/ram/main.js uses it the way
  Night City's mod does. Night City is part of
  https://github.com/vib-z/herdr-layouts, under the MIT License below. This
  copy was changed: room for a floor-number column, and room under the
  towers for their git lines.

- mods/ram/git.js (branch and git counts per space) is ported from the
  spaces mod of the Traveler layout, https://github.com/franky5440-afk/herdr-traveler
  (Copyright 2026 Frank Lin, Apache License 2.0), which is derived from the
  built-in spaces mod of Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app,
  Apache License 2.0). This copy adds each changed file's line counts, and a
  space's repo is the one its first terminal is in.

- mods/ram-text-bigger and mods/ram-text-smaller change settings.json the way
  Herdr's own Settings screen does (Herdr, Apache License 2.0).

- mods/ram-menu (a terminal's right-click menu) has the items of Herdr's own
  menu mod (Herdr, Apache License 2.0), with Copy and Paste added first.

- mods/ram/langs.js gives each language the color and kind GitHub's Linguist
  gives it (https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist, MIT License below).

Everything else (the rest of mods/ram and mods/ram-menu, mods/ram-prefix,
keys.json, layouts/, themes/, nvim/ and tests/) is new code.

